# Mail for the inquiry form on /host-your-event and /weddings.
#
# Without RESEND_API_KEY the endpoint answers honestly -- the form tells the
# visitor it could not send and gives them the inbox to write to -- but no
# inquiry reaches the farm. Set both of these in the Vercel project, for
# Production and Preview, and copy them here for local work.
#
# 1. Create an account at resend.com and add flyingacefarm.com as a domain,
#    which means adding the DNS records it shows you.
# 2. Create an API key with Sending access and paste it below.
# 3. ENQUIRY_FROM must be an address at that verified domain. It is the
#    envelope sender only -- replies go to whoever filled in the form.

RESEND_API_KEY=
ENQUIRY_FROM="Flying Ace Farm <inquiries@flyingacefarm.com>"
